from /scope/prompt-mode/chat-input import ChatInputScope

anchor Prompt_3c5c78c2be24998e:
    userPrompt:
        I'd like a sort of "half tab" between @{ChatInputScope}'s code and spec tabs that is a + icon.  It should be square and slightly smaller than the height of the tabs.  The intent here is that both the code and the spec will be modified.  Which means you'll also need to modify the system prompt to indicate that.  As with tab-to-change selection it will also be tab selectable, and it'll be in the order code, plus, spec

